The applicant made submissions on 5 September 2005 to supplement his complaint to the Administrative Court. The Independent Administrative Panel submitted its observations in reply on 10 October 2005. On 14 July 2006 the Administrative Court, referring to its previous decision, dismissed the applicant’s complaint as unfounded.

On 10 February 1999 the applicant supplemented her complaint with the Administrative Court. On 19 April 1999 the Independent Administrative Panel submitted its comments.
